Odd straightens the bottles on the counter. "A little preparation makes a long road kinder."
+ [Tell me about your supplies.]
    "Each potion restores thirty of its resource. The leather coat adds three Defense. You can change equipment here in town before starting your expedition."
    -> END
+ [Do you buy spare items?]
    "Yes. I pay a quarter of the catalog purchase price, rounded down for each unit. Choose an exact quantity, and unequip gear before selling it."
    -> END
+ [How does rebirth work?]
    "A new life restores your youth and lets you choose another talent. Your skills, AP, possessions and lifetime progress endure. Visit the journey menu while in town."
    -> END
